Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: This value is [Int], but `firsts` returns `Grid<Int>` (which is [[Int]])
  --> Tests/UI/alias_shows_source_name_and_expansion.jet:5:29
    |
  5 | firsts: fn() -> Grid<Int> { [Int]{1} }
    |                             ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `firsts` declares [[Int]] as its result, so the value it hands back must be [[Int]]
 Fix: Wrap the value in a list: `[value]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113

Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `total` wants `Grid<Int>` (which is [[Int]]) for argument 1, but this is [Int]
  --> Tests/UI/alias_shows_source_name_and_expansion.jet:7:25
